{"final":{"answer":"The net change in unrecognized tax benefits from the end of fiscal 2007 (December 29, 2007) to the end of fiscal 2008 (December 27, 2008) is an increase of $87.8 million. This is the fiscal 2008 ending balance of $214.4 million minus the fiscal 2007 ending balance of $126.6 million.","value":87.8,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t8c1n0","source:t1c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}